DESCRIPTION:Dir. Francis Lawrence · 158 min\n\nReturn to the world of Pane
 m 24 years before Katniss Everdeen volunteers in her sister's place\, comm
 encing on the morning of the reaping of the 50th Hunger Games\, also known
  as the Second Quarter Quell.\n\nTickets: https://tickets.omsi.edu/events/
